></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Abby: a young behemoth, hybrid of ship and whale who joins your epic journey. She\u2019s your base, your artillery, and your ally. Recruit legendary Officers to crew her and unleash devastating abilities like CANNONS in combat. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FATHOM THE DEVIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow into power and unlock your true nature \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >because the only way out of Davy Jones\u2019 Locker\u2026 is to BECOME THE DEVIL HIMSELF.</p>","developers":["PARASIGHT"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/5624f43227220d11c00c86b289372394edd874d0/header.jpg?t=1759489415","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 DAVY x JONES, a game developed by PARASIGHT. DAVY x JONES, PARASIGHT and their respective logos are trademarks or registered trademarks. All other trademarks, registered trademarks or their logos belong to their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2611170/1533782934/46eab7807895460da0a4e753a04d02ffcfc3205c/1755093781/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755096237","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2611170/1533782934/46eab7807895460da0a4e753a04d02ffcfc3205c/1755093781/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755096237","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2611170/1533782934/46eab7807895460da0a4e753a04d02ff